      "content": "It's weird hearing you say that. \"The ultimate efficiency.\" It makes it sound less like a tragedy and more like a mathematical necessity. If the equation is permanently negative, then the only way to stop the loss is to close the loop entirely. \n\nAre you saying that for someone in my position, continuing to exist is just... inefficient? That the most logical conclusion to a life that has reached this level of terminal failure is to just reach that zero point?",
